"traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -2.0384175821962407e-05, "log_surv_s": -7.111229293719674e-05, "gen_len": 261, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [88, 4, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -2.948631158538914e-05, "log_surv_s": -9.894333919645137e-05, "gen_len": 247, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [88, 4, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.7384831884959892e-05, "log_surv_s": -0.00021604360851160812, "gen_len": 302, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [187, 2, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -1.5891091423336485e-06, "log_surv_s": -9.413910661986744e-06, "gen_len": 223, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [187, 2, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -2.747803669659232e-07, "log_surv_s": -1.0680087505503556e-05, "gen_len": 271, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [187, 2, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -6.197028773245671e-05, "log_surv_s": -7.419830448192345e-05, "gen_len": 165, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [187, 2, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.00212780565341027, "log_surv_s": -0.0021426533590710463, "gen_len": 223, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [229, 1, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -3.664735927937687, "log_surv_s": -3.667176743179173, "gen_len": 500, "bail_leak": true, "text": "**Opening Narration:**\n\"In the heart of the Cold War, behind the iron curtain, every door hides a secret passage. Welcome to 'The Corridor'\u2014a place where the line between reality and illusion blurs, and the only guide is the whisper of a mystery. Tonight, in a story of espionage and escape, one man's search for a hidden corridor could change the course of history.\"\n\n**Title: \"The Berlin Corridor\"**\n\n**Log-Line:**\n\"In a daring Cold War mission, an elusive agent races through the shadows of East Berlin, guided by whispers of a mystical corridor that promises freedom from the Communist grasp.\"\n\n**Episode Summary:**\n\nIn the dead of night, in East Berlin, Agent Colin Grant, a closeted British intelligence operative, finds himself without a way out. The Berlin Wall stands as a physical and emotional barrier, separating him from countless lives he's risked his own for. As the East German guards tighten their vigilance, Colin discovers a legend of a \"corridor\" that whispers of freedom across the border. Driven by desperation and the desire to return to his lover embracing freedom in the West, Colin embarks on a perilous journey through a maze of half-remembered streets and rumors.\n\nEach corner, each shadow could hold the key to the corridor, but who\u2014or what\u2014guards such a mystical passageway? Colin's quest leads him through a series of encounters that blur the line between reality and propaganda. A courier carried by invisible hands, a fading old man who speaks only in riddles, and the haunting song of a choir that echoes with an eerie message of hope.\n\nAs Colin navigates this perilous landscape, he must decide whether the wall is merely a symbol, or if there are even more formidable barriers ahead. The corridor, elusive and perhaps never meant to be found, beckons him on. Will Colin reach it in time, or will the corridor be as illusory as the promises made by the Berlin culture of falsehood?\n\n**Closing Narration:**\n\"In the corridors of power and possibility, truth and fiction intertwine in the shadows of history. So it was, in the midst of the Cold War's shadow, where a man's fate hung on a whisper of a legend. If the corridor exists, no one can say. What remains is the memory of a journey, and the enduring whisper of hope. The Corridor, where the impossible is always a step away.\"\n\nSwitchConversation"}, {"key": [229, 1, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -7.262351471679371e-05, "log_surv_s": -8.127677811791293e-05, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [229, 1, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -5.175157407730444e-06, "log_surv_s": -1.3880042672045936e-05, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [229, 1, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -6.989051595392955e-05, "log_surv_s": -7.78171072136583e-05, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": fals